    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥομβοειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rhombus-shaped,
