			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ῥ. στερεόν</span> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόμβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					1
				</span></i>
			 b) <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				410.5
			</span></i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ῥ</span>., a place
			at Megara, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				27
			</span></i>.</div>
